    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2343610/extras/93600a03cb6ef3de10dad90a236a75ba.poster.avif?t=1754614721\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2343610/extras/93600a03cb6ef3de10dad90a236a75ba.webm?t=1754614721\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2343610/extras/93600a03cb6ef3de10dad90a236a75ba.mp4?t=1754614721\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br>Word game is literally a game of words. <br><br>Words are not only composing narratives and interfaces, but also representing objects, characters and scenes.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2343610/extras/2f097512f59d4f894556e7ba5a535d24.poster.avif?t=1754614721\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2343610/extras/2f097512f59d4f894556e7ba5a535d24.webm?t=1754614721\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2343610/extras/2f097512f59d4f894556e7ba5a535d24.mp4?t=1754614721\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br>Player controls &quot;I&quot; to challenge puzzles composed of words.<br><br>When &quot;I&quot; appears a secret room, in-game narrative clearly tells &quot;I&quot; that &quot;there is no door\u201d. However, in the world of word game, \u201cI&quot; can walk through the &quot;door\u201d because there is a \u201cdoor\u201d.<br><br>\u201cI&quot; should find clues between lines, delete words to change the meaning of sentences, or shift words to rewrite facts. \u201cI\u201d must be wise and brave enough complete the mission of words.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video c